<title>NORWAY: NORDIC SKIING-FINAL WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS MEDALS TABLE.</title>
<headline>NORDIC SKIING-FINAL WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS MEDALS TABLE.</headline>
<dateline>TRONDHEIM, Norway 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final medals table at</p>
<p>the Nordic skiing world championships which ended on Sunday:</p>
<p> 1. Russia		    6	  1	  3</p>
<p> 2. Norway		    4	  4	  3</p>
<p> 3. Finland		   3	  3	  2</p>
<p> 4. Japan		     2	  2	  0</p>
<p> 5. Italy		     0	  4	  1</p>
<p> 6. Germany		   0	  1	  1</p>
<p> 7. Austria		   0	  0	  2</p>
<p> 8 equal. Czech Republic  0	  0	  1</p>
<p> 8 equal. France	    0	  0	  1</p>
<p> 8 equal. Switzerland     0	  0	  1</p>
</text>
